      "blurb": "Dominant vorcha establishing pack hierarchy through combat",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Vorcha pack leaders have clawed their way to the top of a hierarchy that selects for exactly one thing: the ability to win fights with other vorcha. This makes them considerably more dangerous than standard vorcha, with better-developed adaptive biology, more deliberate tactics, and the social authority to direct other vorcha in ways that ordinary pack members cannot. They are still vorcha, which means deliberation has its limits.</p><p><strong>Pack Command (free action, once per round):</strong> One vorcha ally within 30 ft can use the Strike action as a free action on their next turn.</p><p><strong>Rapid Regeneration:</strong> Fast healing 2 while below half HP.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 40 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p>",
